Maintainer: Lenik <aptkeyman@bodz.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, python3, gettext, asciidoctor, gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/lenik/aptkeyman
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: aptkeyman
Architecture: any
Depends:
    python3,
    gnupg,
    ${misc:Depends}
Suggests:
    python3-wxgtk4.0
Description: manage third-party APT OpenPGP keys
 aptkeyman seeds a local SQLite database of repository signing keys from
 well-known publishers, /usr/share/keyrings, /etc/apt/keyrings, and
 apt-get update missing-key diagnostics. Commands download, update, and
 verify keyring files so apt-get update succeeds for configured sources.
